Given an integer N, check whether it is a Narcissistic number or not.

Note that a Narcissistic number is a number that is the sum of its own digits each raised to the power of the number of digits
Input
8208
Output
Yes
Explanation
84 + 24 + 04 + 84 = 8208
======
n=int(input())
t1=t2=n
c=s=0
while n>0:
    r=n%10
    n=n//10
    c+=1
while t1>0:
    a=t1%10
    s+=a**c
    t1=t1//10
if t2==s:
    print("Yes")
else:
    print("No")
